WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.500
Xavier flag football at night. Players move from the line of scrimmage across the field.

00:06.500 --> 00:13.000
A broadcast excerpt shows Xavier flag football action against Sandra Day O'Connor.

00:13.000 --> 00:20.500
Track athletes sprint at the Phoenix Invitational.

00:20.500 --> 00:23.500
An indoor competition venue screen displays the name L Hopkins.

00:23.500 --> 00:31.500
Sprinters accelerate from the blocks and race at New Balance Nationals Indoor.

00:31.500 --> 00:36.000
Two students wearing Xavier shirts take turns in a Spanish conversation exercise. This excerpt is silent.

00:36.000 --> 00:41.500
Another Xavier flag football excerpt closes the visual highlight montage.
